xes, names, health, distance, and optional tracers.\n\nESP Range – Adjusts the range for player ESP.\n\nFullbright – Increases environmental visibility.\n\nRemove Fog – Removes or reduces in-game fog.\n\nCamera FOV – Adjusts the field of view from 30–120.\n\nTime of Day – Changes the in-game time setting.\n\nCombat Telegraph – Displays incoming attack indicators using ring, bar, or combined styles.\n\nArea Warp – Teleports to selected areas.\n\nPlayer Warp – Teleports to a selected player.\n\nWarp Behind Player – Teleports behind a selected player using an offset.\n\nDynamic Lists – Automatically refreshes available areas and players, including ping information.\n\nAuto Revive – Automatically attempts to revive the player.\n\nAnti-Fling – Protects against fling-style character movement.\n\nDash Cooldown Bypass – Attempts to bypass dash cooldowns.\n\nHide Username – Hides the player's username.\n\nInvisible – Enables invisible-player mode.\n\nNo Slow – Prevents slow effects.\n\nNo Delay – Removes or reduces action delays.\n\nRejoin Server – Rejoins the current server.\n\nServer Hop – Joins another server.\n\nCopy Job ID – Copies the current server Job ID.\n\nAuto Rhythm – Automates the rhythm minigame with adjustable accuracy.\n\nLeaderboard Privacy – Prevents automated rhythm results from appearing on the leaderboard.\n\nAuto Basketball – Automates basketball gameplay.\n\nAuto Shoot – Automatically attempts basketball shots.\n\nGakuran Roblox, Gakuran script, Gakuran Roblox script, Gakuran free script, Roblox Gakuran script, Gakuran auto parry, Gakuran auto attack, Gakuran auto block, Gakuran auto dodge, Gakuran auto counter, Gakuran ESP, Gakuran aimlock, Gakuran aimbot, Gakuran fly, Gakuran noclip, Gakuran speed, Gakuran teleport, Gakuran anti fling, Gakuran auto revive, Gakuran rhythm auto, Gakuran basketball script, Roblox combat script, Roblox fighting script, Roblox script 2026, Snowy Hub Gakuran","tags":["Gakuran","Gakuran Script","Free Gakuran Script","Auto P